// Copy to Signing.xcconfig and set your own team.
//
//   security find-identity -v -p codesigning
//
// prints "Apple Development: you@example.com (XXXXXXXXXX)"; the team ID is the
// OU of that certificate, which Xcode also shows under Signing & Capabilities.
//
// Simulator builds ignore this entirely — they are not signed.
